OL,3,GNEWSAEastenders star launches books
OL,4,Aabout mascots to get kids reading
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow Watt is working to change that, and
OL,7,Fhas written about Stoke City mascot
OL,8,FPottermus and Port Vale's Boomer to
OL,9,Fhelp 3-to-5-year-olds in the area with
OL,10,Freading.
